ries":["本节复述高影响研究设计（妊娠事件的报告与随访）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_496d3a582a244cd3","section_number":"8.8","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:bb0c7cd2b4b4d97833fc3b0d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:40a436d9255d20","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c0e10622ed24c4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5cb5f7385bb976"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006042213_a5702c4c","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"总体研究设计：随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心；II期概念验证+剂量探索，KZ-sGC501三个剂量组与安慰剂对照，治疗12周","quote_sha256":"4268ccf092c0fc0128b80142bfe6658b2700494e8122d4e5d9bac2d766363b93","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_002"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"主要终点：第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化（双盲期）。评价时间点：基线、第4/8/12周。","quote_sha256":"ed3fdeeb458362e8ec2062ccfdb54dabe86146616d3c09971d19582407bead01","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_003"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"估计目标策略：治疗策略（treatment policy）：无论是否剂量调整或合并用药变化，均按随机分组分析；终点前事件按复合策略处理。","quote_sha256":"eb44177581223de72875983b0f1d70b25c2bbcf98304d5b17e2c2764beca8e56","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_004"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"安全性终点：不良事件与严重不良事件发生率；症状性低血压与体位性低血压；生命体征（血压、心率）；肝肾功能、电解质实验室指标；12导联心电图","quote_sha256":"e77501ca084e2f1e9fa18684d494f2252570a19a158da14e097274f13b01fb6b","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_005"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"统计分析策略：FAS为主要分析集；主要终点NT-proBNP百分比变化采用ANCOVA（基线校正）并检验剂量-反应趋势；安全性采用描述统计；次要终点按预先层级顺序分析。","quote_sha256":"9cf37f0df8f4d6bd00beb8c92cebe88f07431911c16227896760d446ca13e075","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_007"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_002","es_003","es_004","es_005","es_007"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[{"action":"由统计团队提供SAP草案，明确ANCOVA协变量、多重性调整策略、缺失数据处理方法、亚组分析计划及剂量-反应趋势检验模型","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_9_sap","missing_source_classes":["统计分析报告（SAP）草案或统计方法学附件"],"target":"9 统计分析"}],"heading":"统计分析","missing_source_classes":["统计分析报告（SAP）草案或统计方法学附件"],"proposal_text":"本研究为随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期概念验证与剂量探索研究，KZ-sGC501低剂量（2.5 mg qd）、中剂量（5 mg qd）、高剂量（10 mg qd）三个剂量组与安慰剂组按1:1:1:1随机分配，治疗期12周。统计分析以全分析集（FAS）为主要分析集，估计目标采用治疗策略（treatment policy），即无论是否发生剂量调整或合并用药变化，均按随机分组进行分析；终点前事件按复合策略处理。主要疗效终点为第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化，采用以基线NT-proBNP为协变量的协方差分析（ANCOVA）进行组间比较，并检验剂量-反应趋势。安全性终点包括不良事件与严重不良事件发生率、症状性低血压与体位性低血压、生命体征（血压、心率）、肝肾功能及电解质实验室指标、12导联心电图，安全性数据以描述统计方式呈现。次要终点按预先设定的层级顺序进行分析。","rationale":"本章正文依据本项目已确认研究定义中的总体设计（随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心）、估计目标策略（treatment policy、复合策略）、主要终点（第12周NT-proBNP百分比变化）、安全性终点清单及统计分析策略（FAS、ANCOVA、剂量-反应趋势、描述统计、层级顺序）撰写。ANCOVA协变量选择、多重性调整、缺失数据处理、亚组分析及剂量-反应趋势检验具体模型参数需统计分析报告（SAP）确认。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（统计分析）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（估计目标）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_ba279ca77c452d59","section_number":"9","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:bb0c7cd2b4b4d97833fc3b0d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:40a436d9255d20","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c0e10622ed24c4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5cb5f7385bb976"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006042213_a5702c4c","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"样本量策略：II期探索性设计：每组约60例（共约240例），基于NT-proBNP组间差值文献效应量与80%把握度估算，用于概念验证与剂量选择。","quote_sha256":"5f598e1d608dd27ea2bd6080417002fe0f5e763c866e33ca8a5c13c697490e10","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_006"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_006"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[{"action":"由医学经理确认NT-proBNP组间差值文献效应量的具体数值和来源文献，并确认80%把握度假设是否充分","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_91_effect_size","missing_source_classes":["NT-proBNP组间差值文献效应量的具体数值及来源文献"],"target":"9.1 样本量"}],"heading":"样本量","missing_source_classes":["NT-proBNP组间差值文献效应量的具体数值及来源文献"],"proposal_text":"本研究为II期探索性设计，采用概念验证与剂量探索策略。计划入组约240例受试者，KZ-sGC501低剂量（2.5 mg qd）、中剂量（5 mg qd）、高剂量（10 mg qd）及安慰剂组各约60例，按1:1:1:1随机分配。样本量估算基于NT-proBNP组间差值的文献效应量，设定80%把握度，用于概念验证与剂量选择。本研究不计划样本量再估计。","rationale":"本章正文依据本项目已确认研究定义中的样本量策略（每组约60例、共约240例、基于NT-proBNP组间差值文献效应量与80%把握度、用于概念验证与剂量选择）及'样本量再估计是否计划：否'撰写。NT-proBNP组间差值文献效应量的具体数值和来源文献未在本项目来源中给出，需医学经理确认效应量假设的合理性及是否需补充敏感性分析。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（样本量）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（剂量选择、样本量、计划入组）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_970b84cdac27496c","section_number":"9.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:bb0c7cd2b4b4d97833fc3b0d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:40a436d9255d20","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c0e10622ed24c4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5cb5f7385bb976"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006042213_a5702c4c","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"统计分析策略：FAS为主要分析集；主要终点NT-proBNP百分比变化采用ANCOVA（基线校正）并检验剂量-反应趋势；安全性采用描述统计；次要终点按预先层级顺序分析。","quote_sha256":"9cf37f0df8f4d6bd00beb8c92cebe88f07431911c16227896760d446ca13e075","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_007"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_83e9420f4f9f88b3:full-draft:bb0c7cd2b4b4d97833fc3b0d","quote":"FAS为主要分析集；主要终点NT-proBNP百分比变化采用ANCOVA（基线校正）并检验剂量-反应趋势；安全性采用描述统计；次要终点按预先层级顺序分析。","quote_sha256":"067b3f77e20da2222b9c91da7106a0b612b21542c62f4e68cae8bb2ae7c09367","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:bb0c7cd2b4b4d97833fc3b0d","span_id":"es_008"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_007","es_008"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[{"action":"由统计团队在SAP中明确安全性分析集的精确定义、次要终点层级顺序及是否设立PPS或敏感性分析集","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_92_safety_set","missing_source_classes":["统计分析报告（SAP）草案或统计方法学附件"],"target":"9.2 统计分析数据集"}],"heading":"统计分析数据集","missing_source_classes":["统计分析报告（SAP）草案或统计方法学附件"],"proposal_text":"本研究设立全分析集（FAS）作为主要分析集。FAS包含所有经随机化分组的受试者，无论其是否实际接受研究药物或完成治疗，均按随机分组归入相应分析组别。主要疗效终点NT-proBNP百分比变化在FAS中采用ANCOVA（基线校正）进行分析并检验剂量-反应趋势。安全性分析集包含所有至少接受一次研究药物给药的受试者，安全性数据以描述统计方式呈现。次要终点按预先设定的层级顺序在FAS中进行分析。","rationale":"本章正文依据本项目已确认研究定义中'FAS为主要分析集'、'主要终点NT-proBNP百分比变化采用ANCOVA（基线校正）并检验剂量-反应趋势'、'安全性采用描述统计'、'次要终点按预先层级顺序分析'及估计目标'treatment policy'撰写。安全性分析集的精确定义（是否包含仅接受安慰剂者、是否排除未给药者）、次要终点层级顺序的具体排列、以及是否设立符合方案集（PPS）或敏感性分析集，需SAP确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_50f2db038b7bd9d4","section_number":"9.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:bb0c7cd2b4b4d97833fc3b0d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:40a436d9255d20","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c0e10622ed24c4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5cb5f7385bb976"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"d2ed5c97f46aea71684da06e90252483d7d8d8760d785ad69e66174ce89a429a","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_83e9420f4f9f88b3:full-draft:bb0c7cd2b4b4d97833fc3b0d","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:bb0c7cd2b4b4d97833fc3b0d","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:9f14082f8ca9ba3e77613e4c62ca77cff3c65d122f60d56d8ea6c8a1ffab8aa1:bb0c7cd2b4b4d97833fc3b0d","text_sha256":"d2ed5c97f46aea71684da06e90252483d7d8d8760d785ad69e66174ce89a429a"},{"content_sha256":"d637529e44577d7b1429b2af86b4b1a8f52590a8b92f2e1d83a773ee335fc31d","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","text_sha256":"d637529e44577d7b1429b2af86b4b1a8f52590a8b92f2e1d83a773ee335fc31d"},{"content_sha256":"e9a73951b4b81029575c055f51e285b89ca3c683bf8d59bb10d324446e599f88","locator":"section:不良事件的随访|block:831|chunk:1","role":"company_so